    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/4a860aaaa1d7a3445a8e452d5100bd83.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/10e082db93b9be8c55b589207a790e6a.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SINGLE OR CO-OP SURVIVAL ADVENTURE GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this adventure, you can progress alone or with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must fight a challenging battle to escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must fight against many elements like hunger, thirst, temperature, sleep deprivation, and creature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ROAD TRIP WITH A VAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect parts to repair your van and hit the road!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vehicle can overheat, get flat tires, break down, or run out of fuel. Despite all this, you must keep going! Your van includes a water tank, a fridge, and a stove for cooking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VEHICLE UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade your vehicle\u2019s wheels and engine, expand storage space, and add extra parts to protect against creature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/623b2c8eb560e29001a4660802b8fbce.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>FEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore abandoned dark areas, buildings, and underground bunkers to find resources with your friends. Be cautious, anything could come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/23404a1883a2b771cd283f96c63c2ba5.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMP &amp; REST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover safe zones in hidden areas free from creatures, set up camp, and rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br><strong>500KM\u00b2 HUGE OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/4a860aaaa1d7a3445a8e452d5100bd83.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/10e082db93b9be8c55b589207a790e6a.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SINGLE OR CO-OP SURVIVAL ADVENTURE GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this adventure, you can progress alone or with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must fight a challenging battle to escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/7b9686ee991dcd63d2bebb6fd1245be5.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must fight against many elements like hunger, thirst, temperature, sleep deprivation, and creature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/294c7b59a680a72451750ffcf97b51a2.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ROAD TRIP WITH A VAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect parts to repair your van and hit the road!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your vehicle can overheat, get flat tires, break down, or run out of fuel. Despite all this, you must keep going! Your van includes a water tank, a fridge, and a stove for cooking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VEHICLE UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade your vehicle\u2019s wheels and engine, expand storage space, and add extra parts to protect against creature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/623b2c8eb560e29001a4660802b8fbce.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/6834d0807e86a8a2c89773aad1df1405.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>FEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore abandoned dark areas, buildings, and underground bunkers to find resources with your friends. Be cautious, anything could come your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/23404a1883a2b771cd283f96c63c2ba5.avif?t=1741144024\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMP &amp; REST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover safe zones in hidden areas free from creatures, set up camp, and rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br><strong>500KM\u00b2 HUGE OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.poster.avif?t=1741144024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.webm?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585430/extras/3add35fc53db50f5824f824bb4ff492a.mp4?t=1741144024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
